  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place potato on lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until just tender, 15-20 minutes (it will finish roasting in step 5!). TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628728c831a182ad620893f9/step-979a6790.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Roughly chop capsicum.\n• Grate carrot. Thinly slice celery.\n• Drain and rinse butter beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628728c831a182ad620893f9/step-5fb2ea35.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, carrot, capsicum and celery, stirring, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628728c831a182ad620893f9/step-aab6bf4f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in butter beans, All-American spice blend and BBQ sauce. Add passata and a splash of water and cook, stirring, until well combined.\n• Season to taste, reduce heat to medium and simmer until thickened, 3-4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628728c831a182ad620893f9/step-e55cb1d4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove potato from oven. Sprinkle with shredded Cheddar cheese.\n• Return to oven to roast until potato is tender and cheese is melted, a further 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628728c831a182ad620893f9/step-17e282ff.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide smokey bean chilli between plates or bowls. Top with cheesy potatoes.\n• Dollop over light sour cream. Tear over parsley to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628728c831a182ad620893f9/step-3aa41080.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
